"Moshk is a votary and jack-of-all-trades wizard on Wathe's Ribbon in Rapport III."
"He has light brown hair, dark skin and a wide grin, and is a little younger than Esh-erdi."
"He considered knighthood but became a votary, and keeps up with all the local gossip."
"His daughter is in the rock class with Esh-erdi's nieces."
